{"id":"sand-pumpkin","name":{"en":"Sand Pumpkin","ja":"砂地かぼちゃ","sc":"砂地南瓜","tc":"砂地南瓜"},"desc":{"en":"While it may be small, this hardy pumpkin can grow quite well with only a tiny amount of water. It is very popular with people in regions suffering from droughts, and it is grown and cherished as a staple food crop in numerous areas.","ja":"少量の水でも立派に育つこぶりだが逞しいかぼちゃ。干ばつに苦しむ地域の人達を中心に広がり、現在では多くの地域で主菜として親しまれている"},"level":2,"slots":1,"evalue":10,"earth":true,"effect":50,"kind":"Material","locations":[{"id":"lush-valley","name":{"en":"Lush Valley","ja":"豊かの谷"},"parent":"baskes-region"},{"id":"solice-trade-camp","name":{"en":"Solice Trade Camp","ja":"孤島の交易キャンプ"},"parent":"baskes-region"},{"id":"plaza-of-great-trees","name":{"en":"Plaza of Great Trees","ja":"大木広場"},"parent":"stellard-southern-archipelago"}],"monsters":[{"id":"bitter-squirrel","name":{"en":"Bitter Squirrel","ja":"シブの実ムササビ"}}],"categories":[{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"category-plant"},{"id":"vegetable","name":{"en":"(Vegetable)","ja":"（野菜）"},"icon":"category-vegetable"}],"index":3,"enum":"ITEM_MAT_SAND_PUMPKIN"}